---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms & Conditions | LinkWA" description="Read our terms and conditions. LinkWA is a free tool for generating WhatsApp click-to-chat links and customizable QR codes.">
<div class="container" style="max-width:680px;padding-top:4rem;padding-bottom:5rem;">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: June 2025</em></p>
    
    <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p>By accessing or using LinkWA (linkwa.in), you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions. If you do not agree to all of these terms, please do not use our website or services.</p>
    
    <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
    <p>LinkWA is a free, web-based utility designed to help users generate WhatsApp click-to-chat links, campaign URLs with UTM tracking parameters, and custom-colored scannable QR codes. We also offer a custom branded short link redirect service (e.g. <code>linkwa.in/yourbrand</code>) powered by our edge redirect system.</p>
    
    <h2>3. Acceptable Use Policy</h2>
    <p>You agree to use LinkWA only for lawful purposes. You are strictly prohibited from:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Using the generated WhatsApp links or custom short links to send spam, unsolicited promotions, or harassing messages.</li>
      <li>Creating short link redirects that point to phishing sites, malware, adult content, or any sites violating local or international laws.</li>
      <li>Attempting to disrupt or exploit our backend systems, API endpoints, or database resources.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We reserve the right to delete any custom short links and block access to our redirect server for any IP address or domain found violating these terms.</p>
    
