    <p>LinkWA is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. We make no warranties, expressed or implied, regarding the reliability, uptime, accuracy, or functionality of the generated links, QR codes, or custom redirect servers. REDIRECT SERVICES MAY BE TEMPORARILY UNSTABLE OR INACCESSIBLE DURING CLOUDFLARE MAINTENANCE OR BANDWIDTH CAP EXCEEDANCES.</p>
    
    <h2>6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>In no event shall LinkWA or its operators be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages (including, but not limited to, loss of business leads, advertising spend, or reputational harm) arising out of the use or inability to use this tool.</p>
    
    <h2>7. Changes to Terms</h2>
    <p>We reserve the right to update these terms at any time without prior notice. The updated version will be marked with a new "Last updated" date at the top of this page.</p>
  </div>
</div>
</Base>
